                                "sense_id": "0eda11c9-9bc1-36cb-b3f7-0ea1f26e31ac",
                                "text": "Patient he sits, while Master Puff, with pomate, tongs, and powder-pluff... gives each hair its proper station..."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
